ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0f7v1MIuA-Bp1Ynrlul_PBnzcrURxShhnirEV697G3wg&oe=69DE29A8"}, "display_name": "Qourt Vision XR - Basketball Training (*DEMO*)", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Requiring a real basketball to play, Qourt Vision XR is a first-of-its-kind mixed reality training tool specifically engineered for basketball players looking to improve their ability to make spilt-second decisions. Enhance your cognitive skills like never before by mastering offensive principles such as: attacking the top foot, assessing a closeout, splitting-the-screen, rolling off the inside shoulder, knowing when to euro step, and much more. Get the mental and physical reps needed to build true self-confidence while immersing yourself in the future of film study and player-development.\ud83d\udcc8\n\nSEE QUICK and REACT FAST with interactive drills focused on\ud83d\udcaa: \n\no\tChange-Of-Pace\no\tChange-Of-Direction\no\tFootwork\no\tBalance\no\tFluidity\no\tRhythm\no\tHand/ Eye Coordination\no\tAgility\no\tStrength and Conditioning\no\tCreating Space/ Separation\n\nMAKE YOUR MIND SWEAT with signature exercises designed for\ud83e\udde0:\n\no\tDecision-Making\no\tReaction Time\no\tPattern Recognition\no\tAttention Shifting\no\tMulti-Tasking\no\tAnticipation\no\tInhibition\no\tVisual Processing\no\tProblem-Solving\no\tProprioception\n\nSay goodbye to plastic cones, chairs, and trashcans.\ud83d\udeab\n\nREAL WORKOUTS. UNREAL DECISIONS.\ud83c\udfc0\ud83c\udfc6 #QourtVisionXR", "short_description": "Requiring a real ball to play, Qourt Vision XR trains cognitive skills such as decision making, reaction time, anticipation, hand/ eye coordination, pattern recognition, and more through hundreds of real in-game simulations for the ultimate interactive basketball workout. Download demo to try for FREE! Visit https://www.handlefitness.com to subscribe and experience all features: $0/mo."}]}, "developer_name": "Handle Fitness", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "